{"ordinal":12565,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453319237638","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Death_0577bfe","source":"Intruder: Или усну.","target":"Intruder: Sau o să adorm.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12566,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453319237637","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Death_0366598","source":"Intruder: Снов нет. Люди обезумели. Я умру.","target":"Intruder: Nu mai există vise. Oamenii au înnebunit. O să mor.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12567,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453319237636","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Death_0c31bed","source":"Intruder: Хотя это больше жутко, чем смешно.","target":"Intruder: Deși e mai degrabă înfiorător decât amuzant.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12568,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453319237635","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Death_0b74ec9","source":"Intruder: Мне немного смешно, что из-за непонятно чего ты решил убить человека.","target":"Intruder: Mi se pare puțin amuzant că ai hotărât să omori un om din cine știe ce motiv.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12569,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453319237634","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Ears_DontShoot_0f8616b","source":"Intruder: Хотя, я бы понял это. Странно.","target":"Intruder: Deși aș putea înțelege asta. Ciudat.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12570,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453319237633","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Ears_DontShoot_06e72e1","source":"Intruder: Может, он тебе приснился?","target":"Intruder: Poate l-ai visat?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12571,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453319237632","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Ears_DontShoot_0207148","source":"Intruder: А ты точно видел этот выпуск новостей?","target":"Intruder: Ești sigur că ai văzut știrea aceea?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12572,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453315043336","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Ears_DontShoot_0349526","source":"Intruder: Интересный выпуск новостей был. На грани сна и реальности.","target":"Intruder: A fost o știre interesantă. La granița dintre vis și realitate.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12573,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453315043335","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Photo_DontShoot_0d6461b","source":"Intruder: Мы-то с естественными ещё не разобрались.","target":"Intruder: Nici măcar lucrurile firești nu le-am lămurit încă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12574,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453315043334","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Photo_DontShoot_041e7ec","source":"Intruder: Меня вообще пугает, как многие помешались в последнее время на каких-то сверхъестественных штуках.","target":"Intruder: Pe mine mă sperie câți oameni au devenit obsedați în ultima vreme de tot felul de lucruri supranaturale.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12575,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453315043333","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Photo_DontShoot_0027c7f","source":"Intruder: Я могу понять всё остальное, но аура.","target":"Intruder: Pot să înțeleg orice altceva, dar aura.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12576,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453315043332","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Photo_DontShoot_0761661","source":"Intruder: Просто… не знаю.","target":"Intruder: Pur și simplu… nu știu.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12577,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453315043331","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Photo_DontShoot_048305f","source":"Intruder: А, из телевизора…Странно.","target":"Intruder: A, de la televizor… Ciudat.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12578,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453315043330","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Photo_DontShoot_0da30ca","source":"Intruder: А где ты услышал об этом признаке?","target":"Intruder: Și unde ai auzit de semnul ăsta?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12579,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453315043329","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Armpit_DontShoot_05b4b8a","source":"Intruder: И со временем становится только хуже.","target":"Intruder: Și cu timpul e tot mai rău.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12580,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453315043328","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Armpit_DontShoot_0bf432a","source":"Intruder: И со временем нарастает какой-то жар.","target":"Intruder: Și, cu timpul, simți cum te cuprinde o căldură.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12581,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453310849031","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Armpit_DontShoot_0ed5b72","source":"Intruder: Когда долго не спишь, начинаешь чувствовать холодок, а через какое-то время сухость.","target":"Intruder: Când nu dormi mult timp, începi să simți un fior rece, iar după o vreme, uscăciune.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12582,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453310849030","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Armpit_DontShoot_0f23611","source":"Intruder: Так ни у кого такого нет?","target":"Intruder: Deci nimeni altcineva nu pățește asta?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12583,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453310849029","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Eyes_DontShoot_0197f9b","source":"Intruder: Да и снов я давно не видел. Что не так в этой всей схеме?..","target":"Intruder: Și nici vise n-am mai avut de mult. Ce nu se leagă în toată povestea asta?..","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12584,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453310849028","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Eyes_DontShoot_0d1bdcb","source":"Intruder: Разве они не высыхают и не устают от постоянной нагрузки?","target":"Intruder: Oare nu se usucă și nu obosesc din cauza efortului continuu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12585,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453310849027","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Eyes_DontShoot_07f0584","source":"Intruder: Нет, а всё-таки. Почему глаза не красные?","target":"Intruder: Nu, totuși. De ce nu sunt ochii roșii?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12586,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453310849026","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Eyes_DontShoot_06381ba","source":"Intruder: Разве они не высыхают и не устают от постоянной нагрузки? Должны стекленеть, наверно.","target":"Intruder: Oare nu se usucă și nu obosesc din cauza efortului continuu? Probabil ar trebui să devină sticloși.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12587,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453310849025","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Eyes_DontShoot_00d8bdf","source":"Intruder: Нет, а всё-таки. Почему глаза темнеют?","target":"Intruder: Nu, totuși. De ce se închid ochii la culoare?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12588,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453310849024","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Hands_DontShoot_0eb7e83","source":"Intruder: Это потеряет смысл.","target":"Intruder: Asta n-ar mai avea sens.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12589,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453306654728","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Hands_DontShoot_08bbaa9","source":"Intruder: Если у меня получится, я перестану себя травмировать.","target":"Intruder: Dacă reușesc, o să încetez să mă mai rănesc.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12590,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453306654727","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Hands_DontShoot_0fb37a9","source":"Intruder: Я просто пытаюсь хоть как-то оказаться во сне.","target":"Intruder: Încerc doar să ajung cumva într-un vis.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12591,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453306654726","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Hands_DontShoot_06aa9f2","source":"Intruder: Почему ты принял мои ногти за грязные?","target":"Intruder: De ce ai crezut că am unghiile murdare?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12592,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453306654725","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Teeth_DontShoot_069fc52","source":"Intruder: Как будто… если они лезут из-под земли, её и зубами будешь грызть, лишь бы выбраться.","target":"Intruder: Parcă… dacă ei ies de sub pământ, ai roade și pământul cu dinții numai ca să scapi.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12593,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453306654724","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Teeth_DontShoot_06d7a84","source":"Intruder: Не было бы логичнее, если бы у Гостей были грязные зубы?","target":"Intruder: N-ar fi mai logic ca Musafirii să aibă dinții murdari?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12594,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453306654723","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Ears_Gun_0a70ca8","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12595,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453306654722","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Ears_Gun_08aa125","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12596,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453306654721","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Ears_Gun_021c4bd","source":"Intruder: Я как-нибудь дальше без этого.","target":"Intruder: O să mă descurc de acum înainte fără asta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12597,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453306654720","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Ears_Gun_09e3725","source":"Intruder: Я как-нибудь дальше в Смерти потусую.","target":"Intruder: O să-mi fac veacul prin Moarte, cumva.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12598,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453302460423","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Ears_Gun_024e57a","source":"Intruder: Чтобы тело так и осталось лежать.","target":"Intruder: Ca trupul să rămână acolo unde zace.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12599,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453302460422","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Ears_Gun_04299e2","source":"Intruder: Чтобы даже если я проснусь, обратно в теле оказаться не смог.","target":"Intruder: Ca, și dacă mă trezesc, să nu mai pot reveni în trup.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12600,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453302460421","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Ears_Gun_0244feb","source":"Intruder: Можешь тогда полностью расстрелять тело?","target":"Intruder: Ai putea atunci să tragi în trup până îl ciuruiești?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-316.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12601,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453302460420","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Photo_Gun_05c2f97","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12602,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453302460419","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Photo_Gun_046af4c","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12603,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453302460418","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Photo_Gun_070d34a","source":"Intruder: Знаешь, у меня к тебе вопросы из-за этого.","target":"Intruder: Știi, din cauza asta am niște întrebări pentru tine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-317.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12604,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453302460417","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Armpit_Gun_0fc6aa0","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12605,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453302460416","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Armpit_Gun_0071a84","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12606,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453298266118","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Armpit_Gun_023ec30","source":"Intruder: Моё тело сохнет без сна. У тебя не так разве?","target":"Intruder: Trupul meu se usucă de la lipsa somnului. Tu nu pățești la fel?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-317.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12607,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453298266117","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Armpit_Gun_0762581","source":"Intruder: А? Реально?","target":"Intruder: Poftim? Pe bune?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-317.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12608,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453298266116","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Eyes_Gun_0d06498","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
