{"ordinal":12610,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453298266114","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Eyes_Gun_0dec343","source":"Intruder: Я не понимаю.","target":"Intruder: Nu înțeleg.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-317.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12611,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453298266113","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Eyes_Gun_068c609","source":"Intruder: Что тебя насторожило тогда?","target":"Intruder: Atunci ce ți-a trezit suspiciuni?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-317.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12612,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453298266112","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Eyes_Gun_053acf5","source":"Intruder: Подожди, разве я подхожу под вот эти признаки Гостя из телевизора?","target":"Intruder: Stai, chiar mă potrivesc cu semnele Musafirilor de la televizor?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-317.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12613,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453294071815","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Eyes_Gun_02db60b","source":"Intruder: Я чувствую себя вяло, но вот глаза становятся только активнее.","target":"Intruder: Mă simt moleșit, dar ochii devin tot mai vioi.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-317.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12614,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453294071814","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Intruder_Eyes_Gun_00dccbb","source":"Intruder: Ищу глазами возможность поспать.","target":"Intruder: Caut cu privirea un loc unde să dorm.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-317.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
